From: Trevor Longino <trevor.longino@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:44:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: solvent dispositions with fail-closed application gate

Invert solvent recommendation flow so evidence-backed candidates and
Hermes dispositions decide eligibility before phrasing. Only
supported_applicable interventions revise assembled/finalized
protocols; CHEM21-only and retrieval failures stay visible hypotheses.
